proof.text:
The bounded complex $K'$ belongs to $D^+(X_{\Et},A)$, and $f$ is quasi-compact and quasi-separated by step 4. Specializing [prop-weil-pbc-comparison-direct-image] to $u=f$, $\Lambda=A$ and its input complex $K'$ gives $\alpha:
u_Y^*L\xrightarrow{\sim}Rf_{\Proet,*}
u_X^*K'$. Applying the functor $Rf_{\Proet,*}$ to $e$ and composing with $\alpha^{-1}$ gives the isomorphism $Rf_{\Proet,*}K\xrightarrow{\sim}
u_Y^*L$.
